---
description: Changing the wire format (payloads, enums, uplink commands) under interfaces/
globs: interfaces/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow docs/guides/changing-the-wire-format.md. The annotated structs
are the single source; regenerate with
interfaces/tools/schemagen/run-schemagen.sh and commit the artefacts
with the source change. Type bytes and enum values are wire-stable.
A changed unit/scale/offset/gate needs a named human datasheet review.
